{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "https://excalidraw.com", "elements": [{"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 20, "width": 464, "height": 30.0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "B. ¿Puedo confiar en lo que llegó?", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 24, "containerId": null, "originalText": "B. ¿Puedo confiar en lo que llegó?", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t0"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 56, "width": 655, "height": 16.25, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "PD-2 + PD-5. Once casos. Las dos decisiones que protegen la versión que Rosa está usando.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "PD-2 + PD-5. Once casos. Las dos decisiones que protegen la versión que Rosa está usando.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t1"}, {"type": "line", "x": 10, "y": 88, "width": 1190, "height": 0, "strokeColor": "#d4d4d8", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "roundness": null, "points": [[0, 0], [1190, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "l2"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 108, "width": 122, "height": 21.25, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "ITERACIÓN #1", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 17, "containerId": null, "originalText": "ITERACIÓN #1", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t3"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 132, "width": 248, "height": 16.25, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "La pregunta que hay que responder", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "La pregunta que hay que responder", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t4"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 164, "width": 276, "height": 150.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "1. El nodo terminó de bajar los archivos\n   de la semana nueva.\n\n2. Antes de mostrarle nada a Rosa tiene\n   que responder una pregunta: ¿esto\n   llegó igual a como salió de Lima?\n\n3. Si la respuesta es no, la regla no se\n   negocia: no se activa nada y la\n   escuela sigue con lo que ya tenía.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1. El nodo terminó de bajar los archivos\n   de la semana nueva.\n\n2. Antes de mostrarle nada a Rosa tiene\n   que responder una pregunta: ¿esto\n   llegó igual a como salió de Lima?\n\n3. Si la respuesta es no, la regla no se\n   negocia: no se activa nada y la\n   escuela sigue con lo que ya tenía.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t5"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 400, "y": 178, "width": 165, "height": 70, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "r6"}, {"type": "text", "x": 400, "y": 189.5, "width": 165, "height": 32.5, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "Archivos\ndescargados", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Archivos\ndescargados", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t7"}, {"type": "text", "x": 400, "y": 224.0, "width": 165, "height": 12.5, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "todavía nadie los vio", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "todavía nadie los vio", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t8"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 630, "y": 172, "width": 200, "height": 82, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1, "updated": 172549440000